{
  "slug": "small-business",
  "name": "Small Business",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Pre-built small business workflows (including payroll planning, month-end close, weekly briefs, and growth campaigns) using your QuickBooks, PayPal, HubSpot, Docusign, Gsuite, O365, Canva, and other connected tools. You approve every step that touches money or customers.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **31 skills** and **11 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (31): `business-pulse` (Produces a one-page cross-functional business snapshot for SMB owners — cash position (QuickBooks), sales trend (PayPal/Square), pipeline movement…), `call-list` (Ranks the top-5 leads most worth calling today, supplies talking points from email history, blocks time on the…), `canva-creator` (Takes an approved content brief and executes a campaign end-to-end: builds the posting calendar, generates Canva designs for…), `cash-flow-snapshot` (Reads AR/AP, historical cash timing, and known fixed costs from QuickBooks, PayPal, Stripe, or Square — or a…), `close-month` (Closes the month — reconciles QB vs payment processors, flags gaps, writes P&L narrative, exports close packet), `content-strategy` (Analyzes sales data from PayPal and QuickBooks to find top performers and slow movers, layers in seasonality, and…), `contract-review` (Lightweight NDA, MSA, and vendor contract review for SMBs without legal on staff), `crm-cleanup` (Scans HubSpot for stale deals, duplicate contacts, and missing fields, then fixes what the owner approves), and 23 more\n- **MCP servers** (11): `quickbooks`, `paypal`, `hubspot`, `canva`, `docusign`, `slack`, `stripe`, `square`, and 3 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install small-business@knowledge-work-plugins` from `anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins` (`small-business`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
